WEBVTT

00:33:28.250 --> 00:33:31.184
and give much more energy to those ideas

00:33:31.208 --> 00:33:32.559
that are germinating

00:33:32.583 --> 00:33:36.309
and that can bring people

00:33:36.333 --> 00:33:40.101
to a common position.

00:33:40.125 --> 00:33:42.434
AG: And tell me how you felt in Paris

00:33:42.458 --> 00:33:45.434
when you succeeded
in closing the agreement.

00:33:45.458 --> 00:33:50.184
CF: It was nonetheless
a moment of utter elation,

00:33:50.208 --> 00:33:51.476
and not just me, right?

00:33:51.500 --> 00:33:55.601
The 5,000 people who were
in that hall, all negotiators,

00:33:55.625 --> 00:33:59.601
plus NGOs plus scientists
plus businesspeople, everyone,

00:33:59.625 --> 00:34:03.768
and as soon as they heard the gavel,
everyone just jumped up